  m_text: 'Sail around the sea and collect the floating money barrels.


    <color=#FFC94A>Small
    barrels  +10</color>  near the start.

    <color=#FFC94A>Big spinning barrels 
    +50</color>  far out, near the edge.


    <color=#FF7A70>A pirate ship guards
    the open sea.</color> If it catches you, your ship sinks.

    Inside the ring
    of red buoys you are safe.


    Collect every barrel to win.'
